<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= escape (text : string) : string = markup.escape text |> markup.markup_text","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := escape (text : string) : string = markup.escape text |> markup.markup_text
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### escape_keeps_markup_out_of_text (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> zig\n\nescape \"<a href=\\\"x\\\"> & b\" |> _assert_eq \"&lt;a href=&quot;x&quot;&gt; &amp; b\"","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> zig

  escape "<a href=\"x\"> & b" |> _assert_eq "&lt;a href=&quot;x&quot;&gt; &amp; b"
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### escape_leaves_plain_text_alone (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> zig\n\nescape \"Behind the Scenes\" |> _assert_eq \"Behind the Scenes\"","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> zig

  escape "Behind the Scenes" |> _assert_eq "Behind the Scenes"
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```
